Version 1.0.3 (2026/08/06)
* Fixed an issue resulting from the incorrect assumption that once-per-event
  quests are flagged by the game as QUEST_REPEAT_EVENT_RESET (in reality, the
  game flags them as QUEST_REPEAT_REPEATABLE_PER_DURATION)
* Fixed an issue where the cooldown for the Sanctum Ophidia quest was not
  being tracked due to an incorrect quest ID on UESP's wiki

Version 1.0.2 (2026/08/03)
* Removed the internal table from the global namespace

Version 1.0.1 (2026/05/11)
* Fixed an oversight in the manifest

Version 1.0.0 (2026/05/11)
* Initial version
